Neural|-15%", "9127494f": "我们带了红红的苹果和紫色的葡萄。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "79aa2a12": "爸爸还烤了很多肉串，香极了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a5050098": "吃完饭，我们坐成一个圆圈，开始猜谜语。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "018f9958": "我先出了一个谜语，请大家来回答。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "25f530c0": "爸爸猜对了，答案是写字用的毛笔。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c8921d95": "妈妈出的谜语，答案是我最爱吃的葡萄干。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "35e22747": "弟弟的谜语最难，答案是能飞上太空的火箭！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a30d9ffd": "我猜对了三个谜语，爸爸跟我握手，说我真聪明。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1d2af995": "天快黑了，我们弯腰把垃圾都捡了起来。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7aa812ab": "回家以后，我把谜语都写了下来，写得太用力，笔尖都断了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9f56488a": "我们坐小船到湖对岸去野餐吧！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c5b239f4": "好！我带了苹果和一串葡萄。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6e6e897b": "我出一个谜语：什么尖尖地上长？|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "21495941": "是竹笋！我答对了吗？|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a16a4c5c": "答对了！你的手握得这么紧，是不是有点儿冷？|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c753fd9f": "有一点儿。我把毛衣穿上吧。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ea28703a": "你看，湖边的柳枝弯弯的，风一吹，像在跳舞。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "29e19dc5": "快看，一只小鸟贴着水面飞过去，快得像一支箭！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "44198524": "说得真好！太阳圆圆的，快下山了，我们坐船回家吧。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d552cb51": "答案|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f65d487f": "问答|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fe0a5ce3": "弯弯|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f4083560": "拐弯|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1b746391": "船长|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "eb633940": "帆船|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9508dc2d": "尖尖|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cea712cf": "塔尖|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "51bfcc59": "握住|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f9db97d1": "握紧|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "99571b49": "羽毛|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "abfb788c": "毛巾|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6075335d": "弓箭|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cbce6064": "箭头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3b4cb66d": "圆圆|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d758b101": "圆形|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a4ce09d7": "一串|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6b0b8807": "串门|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9186bb8b": "苹果树|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e18d857b":